  "task": "I have a calendar event for my Paris trip from August 10-15 and need your help with three things. First, compare Hotel Riviera and Hotel Seine by checking their prices and reviews; second, find rental car options from SpeedRent and CityWheels for those dates including daily rates and vehicle types; and third, verify the opening hours, cuisine details, and ratings for my dinner reservation at Bistro Royale on August 12th."
